by another team for a feature release. [...] With Codex, I offloaded the refactoring and test generation while focusing on other priorities. It produced high-quality, fully tested code that I could quickly hand back — keeping the feature on schedule without adding risk.”\nL205: \nL206: Tres Wong-Godfrey, Tech Lead at Cisco Meraki\n"
